#. module: ssi_school_scholarship
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_scholarship.field_school_scholarship_award_schedule__amount_realized
msgid ""
"Amount actually deducted for this schedule line. Filled by the deduction "
"document, a later module out of this item's scope; always zero until then."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah yang benar-benar dipotong untuk baris jadwal ini. Diisi oleh dokumen "
"potongan, modul berikutnya di luar lingkup item ini; selalu nol sampai saat "
"itu."

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_scholarship.field_school_scholarship_award_schedule__amount_planned
msgid ""
"Amount this schedule line plans to deduct: the Benefit line's Percentage of "
"Base Amount, its Fixed Amount, or the full Base Amount, capped at the "
"Benefit line's Max Amount per Period when that ceiling is above zero. Left "
"untouched on recompute once manually edited -- see Amount Planned Manual."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah yang direncanakan untuk dipotong oleh baris jadwal ini: Persentase "
"dari Jumlah Dasar pada baris Manfaat, Jumlah Tetap-nya, atau seluruh Jumlah "
"Dasar, dibatasi oleh Jumlah Maksimum per Periode pada baris Manfaat bila "
"batas tersebut di atas nol. Tidak dihitung ulang setelah diubah secara "
"manual -- lihat Jumlah Direncanakan Manual."

